# Intent: The word "Offline" in the upper left shows after 45 s without the hub, not 10 s (owner 2026-11-14: the hub installs and restarts every few minutes and each restart flashed the word). The dim amber ring rides the same timer. Patch 112's connecting strip and offline palette, and patch 133's wireless update, are not part of this base; this is only the delay.
# Placement: unit (the link state runs on the robot)
# Upstream: main/protocols/websocket_protocol.cc of the xiaozhi-esp32 tree (MIT)
# Check after a flash: restart the hub and watch the screen: no "Offline" for a restart under 45 s; a longer outage still shows it.
